        "3D Crystallographic Silicatein Ray Vector Symmetry (Cubic O_h 6-Ray Hexactins at theta = 90 deg vs Tetrahedral T_d 4-Ray Tetractins at cos theta = -1/3 = 109.47 deg), Concentric Lamellar Thinning (h_n prop r_n^-1), Checkerboard Diagonal Lattice Shear Stiffness, Cohesive-Zone Laminate Bending FE (Pass 3), Helical Ridge Torsion/Ovalization (Pass 3) & Basalia Step-Index Waveguiding (Pass 3)" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 9.15e-01 .

