<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, and Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements exact crystallographic silicatein filament ray symmetries (`O_h`, `T_d`, `D_3h`, `D_inf_h`; L128-220), a 3D silicic acid reaction-diffusion biosilica accretion PDE solver (`simulate_spicule_biosilica_accretion_3d`, L224-343) with silicatein-inhibited ablation control (`k_cat = 0`), concentric lamellar radial thinning `h_n = h_1*(r_1/r_n)` (`simulate_concentric_lamellar_spicule`, L370-435), and *Euplectella* alternating checkerboard diagonal lattice shear stiffness (`simulate_euplectella_lattice_mechanics`, L439-483). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_076_sponge_spicule_hexactin.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
